me on &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/clinton-atayero-3800b5238/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;
if this was useful.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;ontend Web Developer specializing in Next.js &amp;amp; React. Expert in Tailwind CSS and high-end animations with GSAP.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Creator of Noir Archive 📽️&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
